p=root/'site/conquista/conquista.css';p.write_text(p.read_text()+"\n/* v2.1 — all places respond, persistent place list, touch-safe labels and audio. */\n#soundToggle{border:1px solid #dbc98e70;color:var(--gold);position:relative;flex:0 0 38px}\n#soundToggle.muted{color:var(--muted);border-color:var(--line)}\n#soundToggle.muted:after{content:'';position:absolute;width:22px;height:2px;background:currentColor;rotate:-45deg;border:1px solid #102a23;pointer-events:none}\n#soundSettings{border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #ead99c55;background:none;color:var(--gold);font-size:10px;padding:3px 0;margin-left:auto;min-width:44px;min-height:28px}\n.sound-choice{display:flex!important;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:11px 13px;border:1px solid #e1d9b22c;border-radius:12px;margin:4px 0 17px;font-size:12px!important;cursor:pointer;background:#153a2b66}\n.sound-choice input{width:18px!important;height:18px!important;margin:0!important;padding:0!important;accent-color:#c9ba83;flex:0 0 18px}\n.sound-choice small{display:block!important;font-size:9px!important;font-weight:400;color:#bed0bc;line-height:1.5;margin-top:3px}\n.audio-enable{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:#234033;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:13px;margin:20px 0}\n.audio-enable input{width:22px;height:22px;accent-color:#e3d2a0}\n.volume-controls label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;margin:17px 0 6px}\n.volume-controls input{display:block;accent-color:#dfd096;width:100%;min-height:34px;margin:0 0 13px;padding:0}\n.volume-controls output{color:var(--gold)}.audio-dialog{width:min(470px,calc(100vw - 24px))}\n.audio-dialog .small-note{line-height:1.6;margin-top:13px}.audio-dialog #testSound{width:100%;margin-top:10px}\n.map-browse{position:absolute;left:12px;top:12px;z-index:12;display:flex;gap:7px}\n.map-browse button{min-height:41px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #e2d3a44a;background:#12382bf2;padding:8px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:11px;backdrop-filter:blur(8px)}\n.map-browse button:first-child{background:var(--gold);color:#183328;font-weight:600}.map-browse svg{width:18px;height:18px}\n.map-tools{z-index:12}.map-info{padding-top:14px}.map-info .eyebrow{display:block;padding-right:27px}\n.collapse-map{position:absolute;right:6px;top:5px;width:33px;min-height:31px;border:0;border-radius:9px;background:#ffffff0b;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:20px}\n.map-info.collapsed{max-width:280px;padding:9px 40px 9px 13px}\n.map-info.collapsed h2,.map-info.collapsed p,.map-info.collapsed .map-actions{display:none}\n.map-info.collapsed .eyebrow{padding:0}.map-info.collapsed .collapse-map{rotate:180deg;top:1px}\n#locationLeaders{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none;z-index:2;overflow:visible;fill:#eaddaa;stroke:#f2e7bfad;stroke-width:1.2}\n.map-pin{transform:none!important;box-sizing:border-box;width:153px;height:44px;padding:4px 7px 4px 4px;border-radius:13px;white-space:normal;gap:7px;text-align:left;background:#11372bf2;min-height:44px;box-shadow:0 3px 10px #0004}\n.map-pin b{width:28px;height:28px;border:1px solid #f0df9b8c;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:0 0 28px;color:#f2e7bf;font-size:10px;font-weight:500}\n.map-pin span{font-size:10px;line-height:1.12;color:#f6f0da}.map-pin.active{background:#3e5740;border-color:#efd692;z-index:6}\n#player{z-index:2}.locations-dialog{width:min(610px,calc(100vw - 20px))}.locations-dialog h2,.place-dialog h2,.audio-dialog h2{font-size:29px}\n#locationList{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:9px;margin-top:20px}\n.location-card{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;text-align:left;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;min-height:77px;background:#234234;color:var(--ivory);padding:11px}\n.location-card i{display:grid;place-items:center;width:34px;flex:0 0 34px;height:34px;background:#dcd4a511;border-radius:10px;color:var(--gold)}\n.location-card span{flex:1}.location-card b{display:block;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:500}.location-card small{display:block;margin-top:5px;color:#b5cbaa;font-size:9px}.location-card>svg{width:14px;opacity:.6}\n.place-dialog{width:min(510px,calc(100vw - 24px));padding:0}.place-dialog>img{display:block;width:100%;height:180px;object-fit:cover;background:#254839}.place-dialog .closebutton{background:#102a23e8;z-index:1}\n.place-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:17px 0}.place-actions button{flex:1;white-space:nowrap;font-size:12px}\n#placeLevels h3{font-size:14px;margin:20px 0 11px}.place-level{display:flex;align-items:center;text-align:left;gap:11px;background:#21432f;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;width:100%;padding:11px;margin:7px 0;min-height:56px}\n.place-level.locked{background:#122e23;color:#bac7b7}.place-level svg{color:var(--gold)}.place-level b{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:500}.place-level small{display:block;font-size:10px;line-height:1.4;margin-top:4px;color:#b4c8ad}\n@media(max-width:650px){.map-pin{width:124px;gap:5px}.map-pin span{font-size:9px}.map-pin b{width:26px;height:26px;flex-basis:26px}.map-browse{gap:5px}.map-browse button{font-size:10px;padding:8px 10px}.map-browse #mapOverview{padding:8px}.map-info.collapsed{right:60px}.location-card{gap:7px;padding:9px;min-height:82px}.location-card i{width:28px;flex-basis:28px}.location-card i svg{width:18px}.location-card b{font-size:11px}.location-card>svg{display:none}.wallet{gap:4px}.topbar{gap:7px}.brand{font-size:19px;letter-spacing:.23em}.wallet>span,.wallet>button:not(.iconbutton){padding:7px;gap:3px}.wallet #soundToggle{flex-basis:33px;width:33px}.identity{letter-spacing:0}.identity span{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;max-width:160px}#soundSettings{font-size:9px}.place-dialog>img{height:140px}.place-dialog .dialog-body{padding:19px}}\n@media(max-width:374px){.topbar{padding-left:12px;padding-right:12px}.brand{font-size:17px}.brand small{font-size:5px}.wallet{gap:3px}.wallet small{display:none}.wallet>span,.wallet>button:not(.iconbutton){padding:6px}.wallet .iconbutton{width:30px!important;flex-basis:30px!important}.wallet svg{width:14px}.map-browse #mapOverview{font-size:9px}}\n@media(max-height:520px) and (orientation:landscape){.map-info:not(.collapsed){max-width:285px}.map-pin{width:124px;font-size:9px}.map-pin span{font-size:9px}.place-dialog>img{height:100px}#locationList{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.location-card{min-height:76px}.map-info.collapsed{bottom:65px}}\n")

p=root/'site/conquista/README.md';p.write_text(p.read_text()+"\n\n## v2.1 — places and interactive sound\nAll nine places from the labelled masterplan are now available to inspect and visit from the beginning. Clube e Piscinas, Acesso principal and Parque das Árvores were added to the game. The place list remains accessible even when a marker is outside the zoomed viewport. Markers no longer disappear when the character approaches them. Labels have collision-aware layout and leader lines; the location cards show a thumbnail, description, travel action and available or locked activities with a clear prerequisite. Phase locks, 15 phases, 45 stars and reward rules are unchanged.\n\nThe original graph's node indices are preserved. Additional approximate routes connect the previously missing places. Gate, courts and equestrian labels agree with the existing masterplan. This is still an illustration, not a surveyed route.\n\nThe optional local Web Audio system starts only from a user gesture, including the explicit 'Jogar com som' start option. It includes wind, water and synthetic bird-like ambience, footsteps/hoofbeats, route feedback, memory-pair and sequence tones, camera clicks, sports hits, item placement, arrival and reward sounds. Three volume controls independently set master, effects and ambient sound. Mute and preference persistence are provided. Backgrounding suspends sound; the next deliberate interaction can recover interrupted audio. No audio files, third-party network calls, microphone or camera permissions are used. Activities retain all visual instructions and remain playable with sound disabled or unavailable.\n\nThe existing v2 progress key is retained; no stars, virtual Sóis, outfits or purchases are reset. Audio preferences use a separate key. `tests/solaris-map-audio.cjs` verifies all nine places, travel reachability, label hit testing, actual nonzero Web Audio samples, mute/zero volume, interruption recovery, sound cues, legacy progress preservation and unavailable-audio fallback. Automated WebKit is not a hardware iPhone listening test.\n")
